An optional field the lens moves into a required one, and another it would
copy: the move is reported at its mapping, where its fix is written, and the
copy at the lens, where its own is. The two are not grouped, since their
fixes are written in different places.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id:     string
	owner?: string
	team?:  string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id:    string
	owner: string
	team:  string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id:    v0_0.id
		owner: v0_0.owner
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id:    string
	owner: string
	team:  string
}
-- out/error --
error[E0343]: owner is optional in v0.0 and v1.0 requires owner
  --> history/1.0.thema:11:3
   |
11 |         owner: v0_0.owner
   |         ^^^^^
   |
   = help: write _coalesce(v0_0.owner, <fallback>) to say what to use when it is absent

error[E0343]: team is optional in v0.0 and required in v1.0
 --> history/1.0.thema:7:1
  |
4 |     team:  string
  |     ---- v1.0 requires team
...
7 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: write team: _coalesce(v0_0.team, <fallback>) to say what to use when it is absent
